From d241073cd386397858938042a9c40f7b2293449f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:06:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] test-posix: Check <sys/wait.h> and the groups, statuses
 and signals of the wait functions

Check the <sys/wait.h> declarations and that it doesn't expose
<sys/resource.h>; waitpid's process-group selection, status values and
replaced stop statuses; EINTR; that orphans get a new parent; the
waitid idtype, option and WNOWAIT handling; WCOREDUMP against
CLD_DUMPED and RLIMIT_CORE 0; the clearing of a blocked SIGCHLD;
cancellation with bad arguments; and wait3.
